=== Metropolitan Administrations ===
There are 8 Metropolitan Administrations in Burawa that act as an additional governing body to groups of urban administrations that border or are nearby each other. The Metropolitan Administration acts as a regional governing body that handles higher level administrative tasks such as regional transportation systems, shared utilities and other shared services that can reduce the burden of nearby localities. The Metropolitan Administration leadership is composed of a Governor and Lt Governor that works with Urban Administrator governors to accomplished shared tasks. 74 million people , amajority of Burawa's population, lives within metropolitian administrations.

